{"ID":"20240205153910-xaqzevj","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153910-xaqzevj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153910-xaqzevj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101519-0a7d2mo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607144223-w9bumkr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1820,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620161431-rdaebk8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:9,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:9\u0026#125;","title":"104蔓荆子","type":"doc","updated":"20240809163403"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240809154534-ftjxwj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240809154534-ftjxwj7","updated":"20240809154548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三叶蔓荆"}]},{"ID":"20240206101519-0a7d2mo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101519-0a7d2mo","updated":"20240206101527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产江西、浙江、山东等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈球形，直径46mm。表面灰黑色或黑褐色，被灰白色粉霜状茸毛，有纵向浅沟4条，顶端微凹，基部有灰白色宿萼及短果梗。萼长为果实的1/32/3，5齿裂，其中 2裂较深，密被茸毛。体轻，质坚韧，不易破碎。横切面可见4室，每室有种子1枚。气特异而芳香，味淡、微辛。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t疏散风热，清利头目。用于风热感冒头痛，齿龈肿痛，目赤多泪，目暗不明，头晕目眩。"}]},{"ID":"20240206101520-9fwp8il","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101520-9fwp8il","updated":"20240206101520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206101520-o9slo80.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155126-eg6us80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155126-eg6us80","updated":"20240205155126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"